                     <body>Documentation
=============

Original
--------

Reference
.........
cdi:references


CDIF
----

Definition
..........
CDIF codelist (skos:ConceptScheme) whose concepts define the allowed values of this enumeration domain.

Scope
.....
cdi:references - the PrimaryKey on another DataStructure that this foreign key references.
</body>
                  </ownedComment>
