                  <ownedComment xmi:id="DiscoveryDataDescriptionStructure.RepresentedVariable-simpleUnitOfMeasure-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.1/composite/xmi/#RepresentedVariable-simpleUnitOfMeasure-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="DiscoveryDataDescriptionStructure.RepresentedVariable-simpleUnitOfMeasure"/>
                     <body>The unit in which the data values are measured (kg, pound, euro), expressed as a simple string, in cases where no additional information is available (in the legacy system) or needed (as in the case of broad agreement within the community of use [i.e., ISO country codes, currencies, etc. in SDMX])</body>
