                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="DiscoveryDataDescriptionStructure.RepresentedVariable-externalDefinition"/>
                     <body>A reference to an external definition of a concept (that is, a concept which is described outside the content of the DDI-CDI metadata description). An example is a SKOS concept. The definition property is assumed to duplicate the external one referenced if externalDefinition is used. Other corresponding properties are assumed to be included unchanged if used.</body>
